From ce8ef46508bb274ace033b789100b1d228c658a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GaoChao <gaochao24@huawei.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Jan 2026 09:47:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/18] feat: add syslog logging for OBMM operations

- Add libobmm_log.h with logging macros and inline helper
- Add logging to export/import/unexport/unimport operations
- Use EID_FMT64/ARGS64 macros for direct 16-byte ID formatting
- Log operation parameters, results, and elapsed time
- Unify vendor_adaptor logging with OBMM_LOGE macro

Signed-off-by: GaoChao <gaochao24@huawei.com>
Signed-off-by: yuhao_zhang <yuhao.zhang@huawei.com>
